WEBVTT

00:03.500 --> 00:05.500
<v Dee>Don't make it gentle.</v>

00:05.500 --> 00:07.000
<v Pat>Ray.</v>

00:07.000 --> 00:15.500
<v Uncle Ray>You lost because you started playing the room instead of your partner — not a tragedy, just information.</v>

00:15.500 --> 00:22.000
<v Pat>The book has today's result in it. It also has plenty of blank lines after.</v>

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
<v Dee>Then we owe the table another try.</v>
